//- Arrows in motion: a dot per request, dashes for a stream
diagram(dir="right")

  card#phone.client(icon="smartphone") Mobile app
    to(gateway).pulse requests

  card#gateway.svc(icon="shield") API gateway
    to(orders).pulse
    to(stock).pulse

  card#orders.svc Orders
    to(kafka).flow.orders events
  card#stock.svc Stock

  card#kafka.store(icon="activity") Event stream
